== Description ==

'''Clay''' is a mineable rock in ''[[Human Host]]'', crafted at the [[Campfire]]. It appears as an ingredient in 14 downstream recipes at 3 different workbenches, including [[Steel Buckshot]], [[Copper Buckshot]], [[Tungsten Bullet Tip]], [[Titanium Buckshot]], [[Bullet Shell]], [[Tungsten Buckshot]], among others. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

